{"id":"n18366-1-9","stage":2,"title":"고추 · 辣椒","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18366-1-9-1","ko":"너 왜 그렇게 땀을 흘리니?","zh":"你怎么出了这么多汗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그렇게：“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36292","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀을","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흘리니?","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"b470a873a66143d2","term":"그렇게","zh":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3","entryId":"36292","definition":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"汗液、眼泪、鼻涕、血、口水等液体从体内排出。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5327aa15b75c28f8662.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18366-1-9-2","ko":"된장찌개에 고추가 많이 들어갔는지 너무 매워서 땀이 나요.","zh":"大酱汤里可能放了很多辣椒，太辣了，辣得冒汗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"된장찌개에","meaning":"韩式大酱汤","explanation":"된장찌개：韩式大酱汤；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"된장찌개","audio":"/audio/fa09ba8b4950af996222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14930","senseId":"1","lemma":"된장찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고추가","meaning":"辣椒","explanation":"고추：辣椒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고추","audio":"/audio/ffc402fc1aeb91aaed21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18366","senseId":"1","lemma":"고추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어갔는지","meaning":"包含，插入，夹进","explanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매워서","meaning":"辣","explanation":"맵다：辣；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74131","senseId":"1","lemma":"맵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀이","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fa09ba8b4950af99","term":"된장찌개","zh":"韩式大酱汤","audio":"/audio/fa09ba8b4950af996222.mp3","entryId":"14930","definition":"将大酱拌入水中，并放入葱、西葫芦、豆腐等食材后煮制而成的浓汤。","pronunciation":["된ː장찌개","뒌ː장찌개"]},{"id":"ffc402fc1aeb91aa","term":"고추","zh":"辣椒","audio":"/audio/ffc402fc1aeb91aaed21.mp3","entryId":"18366","definition":"一种有辣味的果实，手指般大小，开始为绿色，成熟后变红。","pronunciation":["고추"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"包含，插入，夹进","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"被插到某物内。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"13d9c3d2d64fee08","term":"맵다","zh":"辣","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3","entryId":"74131","definition":"像辣椒或芥末等那样味道有刺激性，舌尖有刺痛感。","pronunciation":["맵따"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2e912e873428e737c58.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.407,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18366","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1323,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大酱汤里可能放了很多辣椒，太辣了，辣得冒汗。","你怎么出了这么多汗？","明天早上的最低气温会降到零下二十度哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么出了这么多汗？","明天早上的最低气温会降到零下二十度哦。","大酱汤里可能放了很多辣椒，太辣了，辣得冒汗。"],"answer":2}]}
